# Scratch renders and fixtures from chart work — regenerable, never source of truth.
#
# ROOT-ANCHORED with a leading slash, unlike the patterns above. A bare `_*.json` matches at any
# depth and would have swallowed migrations/meta/_journal.json — Drizzle's migration journal, which
# IS tracked and IS source of truth. `client/public/_headers` and `scripts/_forensics.ts` are
# tracked too. Scratch files only ever land at the repo root, so that is the only place to ignore.
/_*.png
/_*.jpg
/_*.jpeg
/_*.json
/_*.sh
